  "scope_notes": "The PR incorporates the first 3 commits from #35918. It also includes 4 commits authored by w0xlt for key and policy inspection, with detailed changes listed in the PR description.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Added a dedicated release note file (doc/release-notes-36885.md) covering the new analyzedescriptor RPC and getdescriptorinfo verbose argument.",
  "card": "Bitcoin Core adds descriptor key and policy inspection alongside multisig structure verification via AnalyzeDescriptor. Participants in multisig setups currently have no Core RPC to verify that a coordinator-supplied descriptor strictly enforces the intended k-of-n policy without hidden spending paths or duplicate keys that lower the threshold. The analysis is exposed without a wallet via getdescriptorinfo verbose, and with wallet key-matching and address derivation via analyzedescriptor. This PR depends on #35918 and advances the multisig setup workflow in #35645.",
